'''Mushroom Bull''' is a hostile [[Mobs|Mob]] found in the {{Zone|Mystic Marsh}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Mushroom Bulls''' are hostile mobs that run quickly (sometimes in circles) and attack players with melee strikes. They graze {{Item|Mushroom Spore}}s when walking over them (without healing). After consuming spores, their deaths trigger nearby {{Item|Brown Mushroom}} explosions, similarly to the effect after consuming {{ID|Marsh Spore Soup
}}.

